# Portrait phone (DPR 3): Play leads a first-timer to the tutorial; dropped by the tray's Drop and swipes on the crate (aim, drop on release) through its three steps; the settings card from the pause card (palette, haptics); Leave run.
# viewport 390x844@3
until 300 =▶ Play
frames 150
save phone-title
touch =▶ Play
until 60 A 3-step interactive tutorial
frames 10
touch =Start
until 300 =Drop
frames 200
save phone-play
repeat 4000 until Step 3/3
  touch =Drop
  frames 34
end
frames 5
swipe 40% 50% 60% 50% 8
frames 40
swipe 60% 50% 30% 50% 8
frames 40
touch =Skip
frames 30
save phone-step3
touch =Pause
until 60 =Paused
frames 10
touch =Settings
until 60 Color palette
frames 10
touch =Default
frames 10
touch =Citrus
frames 10
save phone-settings
touch =Done
until 60 =Paused
frames 10
touch =Resume
frames 60
save phone-citrus
touch =Pause
until 60 =Paused
frames 10
touch =Leave run
until 60 Resume last run
frames 10
